{
  "job_B3.3.32_20251003_114718": {
    "chunk_text": "der on Ond \u00fea \u00e6fter \u00feon het Neron gewyrcean mycelne tor of treowum & of mycclum beamum, & bead \u00fe\u00e6t \u00dea o\u00fere d\u00e6ge heht Neron Petrus & Paulus to \u00feissum w\u00e6ferfeonum gefeccean, & him tocw\u00e6\u00fe, Nu Petrus & Paulus cw\u00e6don, God hine onwryh\u00fe gyt, \u00feeah \u00fee wit hine ne geopenian. Min gemet is, cw\u00e6\u00fe Paulus, \u00fe\u00e6t ic bege mine cneowa. \u00deu miht \u00e6t Gode abbiddan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu wilt wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s dryg onginne, for\u00feon \u00feu \u00e6r gecoren w\u00e6re fram gode. & \u00fea dyde he swa Paulus, & begde his cneowa & hine geb\u00e6d. Petrus beheold Simon & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Ongin \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu onginnest, for\u00feon nu neal\u00e6ce\u00fe \u00e6g\u00feer ge \u00fein Neron cw\u00e6\u00fe, Hwyder magon gyt gangan from minum willan. Petrus cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00feyder \u00fee unc mon la\u00fea\u00fe & ceg\u00fe uncer Drihten. \u00dea beforan eallum \u00fe\u00e6m folce astag Simon on \u00feone torr, & a\u00feenedum earmum, mid lawere gebeagod, Sona swa Neron \u00fe\u00e6t geseah, \u00fea cw\u00e6\u00fe he, \u00fees man is so\u00fef\u00e6st & so\u00fesecgende Simon, ac \u00feonne \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe him Petrus to, Buton yldinge \u00feu wast \u00fe\u00e6t wit syndon so\u00fee Cristes \u00feeowas, & \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fees man Neron cw\u00e6\u00fe, Gyt git \u00feurhwunia\u00f0 on incre anwilnesse, & nu git geseo\u00fe hine geond heofenas feran. \u00dea locode Petrus to Paule & cw\u00e6\u00fe, R\u00e6",
